pic_hlSiteTopic" href="./">Travelers' Health - Yellow Book</a></h2></div></div><div id="content"><div id="content-inner"><div id="nav-container"><div id="nav"><h3><a href="/travel/">Home</a></h3><ul id="nav-primary"><li><a href="/travel/destinationList.aspx" title="Destinations">Destinations</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/regionList.aspx" title="Regions">Regions</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentVaccinations.aspx" title="Vaccinations">Vaccinations</a></li><li><a href="/travel/news.aspx" title="Travel Notices">News &amp; Announcements</a></li><li><a href="/travel/notices.aspx" title="Travel Notices">Travel Notices</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentDiseases.aspx" title="Diseases">Diseases</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentYellowBook.aspx" title="Yellow Book">Yellow Book</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/ybSearch.aspx" title="Search">Search</a></li><li><a href="/travel/ybToc.aspx" title="Contents">Contents</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/ybToc.aspx#1" title="Chapter 1">Chapter 1</a></li><li><a href="/travel/ybToc.aspx#2" title="Chapter 2">Chapter 2</a></li><li><a href="/travel/ybToc.aspx#3" title="Chapter 3">Chapter 3</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/yellowBookCh3-IntroGoalsLimitations.aspx" title="Introduction">Introduction</a></li><li><a href="/travel/yellowBookCh3-Africa.aspx" title="Africa">Africa</a></li><li><a href="/travel/yellowBookCh3-Americas.aspx" title="Americas">Americas</a></li><li><a href="/travel/yellowBookCh3-Asia.aspx" title="Asia">Asia</a></li><li><a href="/travel/yellowBookCh3-MiddleEast.aspx" title="Middle East">Middle East</a></li><li><a href="/travel/yellowBookCh3-Europe.aspx" title="Europe">Europe</a></li><li><a href="/travel/yellowBookCh3-AustraliaSouthPacific.aspx" title="Australia and the Pacific Islands">Australia and the Pacific Islands</a></li><li><a href="/travel/yellowBookCh3-References.aspx" title="References">References</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/ybToc.aspx#4" title="Chapter 4">Chapter 4</a></li><li><a href="/travel/ybToc.aspx#5" title="Chapter 5">Chapter 5</a></li><li><a href="/travel/ybToc.aspx#6" title="Chapter 6">Chapter 6</a></li><li><a href="/travel/ybToc.aspx#7" title="Chapter 7">Chapter 7</a></li><li><a href="/travel/ybToc.aspx#9" title="Chapter 8">Chapter 8</a></li><li><a href="/travel/ybToc.aspx#11" title="Chapter 9">Chapter 9</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/yellowBookListOfMaps.aspx" title="Maps">Maps</a></li><li><a href="/travel/yellowBookListOfTables.aspx" title="Tables">Tables</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentYellowBookAbout.aspx" title="About">About</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentWhatsNew.aspx" title="What's New">What's New</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentYellowBookUpdates.aspx" title="Updates">Updates</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentFindClinic.aspx" title="Find a Clinic">Find a Clinic</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentTravelClinics.aspx" title="Travel Medicine Clinics">Travel Medicine Clinics</a></li><li><a href="/travel/yellowFever.aspx" title="Yellow Fever Vaccinations Clinics">Yellow Fever Vaccinations Clinics</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentYellowFeverRegistryFAQ.aspx" title="FAQ">FAQ</a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentSpecificGroups.aspx" title="Specific Groups &amp; Settings">Specific Groups &amp; Settings</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentChildTravel.aspx" title="Traveling with Children">Traveling with Children</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentSpecialNeeds.aspx" title="Special Needs">Special Needs</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentReliefWorkers.aspx" title="Disaster Relief">Disaster Relief</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentAvianFluInformation.aspx" title="Avian Flu &amp; Travel">Avian Flu &amp; Travel</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentAvianFluQA.aspx" title="Question &amp; Answer">Question &amp; Answer</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentAvianFluPassengerChecks.aspx" title="Avian Flu Checks">Avian Flu Checks</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentAvianFluPoster.aspx" title="Bird Smuggling Poster">Bird Smuggling Poster</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentAvianFluAirlinesCleaning.aspx" title="Airline Cleaning Crew">Airline Cleaning Crew</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentAvianFluBirdCollisions.aspx" title="Bird Collisions">Bird Collisions</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentAvianFluArrivingFromAreas.aspx" title="Meeting Passengers">Meeting Passengers</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentSpanishContentList.aspx" title="Info en espa&#241;ol">Info en espa&#241;ol</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentSpanishAvianFluAsia.aspx" title="Para los viajeros">Para los viajeros</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentSpanishAvianFluAmericansAbroad.aspx" title="En el extranjero">En el extranjero</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentSpanishAvianFluQA.aspx" title="Preguntas y respuestas">Preguntas y respuestas</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentSpanishAvianFluPosterBirds.aspx" title="Contrabando de aves">Contrabando de aves</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentSpanishAvianFluArrivingFromAreas.aspx" title="La tripulaci&#243;n de vuelo">La tripulaci&#243;n de vuelo</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentSpanishAvianFluAirlinesCleaning.aspx" title="El personal de limpieza">El personal de limpieza</a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentAirTravelCruiseShips.aspx" title="Air &amp; Cruise Ship Travel">Air &amp; Cruise Ship Travel</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentInfoForTravelers.aspx" title="For Travelers">For Travelers</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentTravelIndustryAir.aspx" title="For Industry: Air">For Industry: Air</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentIllReportingFlightAttendants.aspx" title="Ill Passengers on Flights">Ill Passengers on Flights</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentIllReportingAviation.aspx" title="Notification of Ill Passengers">Notification of Ill Passengers</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentMeaslesFlightCrew.aspx" title="Flight Crew Info: Measles">Flight Crew Info: Measles</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentMenin.aspx" title="Meningococcal Exposure">Meningococcal Exposure</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentTravelIndustryCruise.aspx" title="For Industry: Cruise Ships">For Industry: Cruise Ships</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentIllReportingMaritime.aspx" title="Ill Passengers on Ships">Ill Passengers on Ships</a></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentStudyAbroad.aspx" title="Study Abroad">Study Abroad</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentStayHealthy.aspx" title="Stay Healthy &amp; Safe">Stay Healthy &amp; Safe</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentSurvivalGuide.aspx" title="Survival Guide">Survival Guide</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentLearnAboutDestination.aspx" title="Learn About Destination">Learn About Destination</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentSeeDoctor.aspx" title="See a Doctor">See a Doctor</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentPreparingForAppointment.aspx" title="Pre-Travel Appointment">Pre-Travel Appointment</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentHealthStatus.aspx" title="Your Health Status">Your Health Status</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentInfectiousDiseases.aspx" title="How Diseases Spread">How Diseases Spread</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentPackSmart.aspx" title="Pack Smart">Pack Smart</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentPlanAhead.aspx" title="Plan Ahead for Illness">Plan Ahead for Illness</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentSickDuringTrip.aspx" title="Sick While Traveling">Sick While Traveling</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentImportantInfo.aspx" title="Know &amp; Share Info">Know &amp; Share Info</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentRegisterContactInfo.aspx" title="Traveler Registration">Traveler Registration</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentHealthDuringTrip.aspx" title="During Trip">During Trip</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentAfterTrip.aspx" title="After Trip">After Trip</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentInsectProtection.aspx" title="Mosquito &amp; Tick Protection">Mosquito &amp; Tick Protection</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentMosquitoTick.aspx" title="Bite Prevention">Bite Prevention</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentSafeFoodWater.aspx" title="Safe Food &amp; Water">Safe Food &amp; Water</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentWaterTreatment.aspx" title="Water Treatment Methods">Water Treatment Methods</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentDiarrheaDrugApproved.aspx" title="Travelers' Diarrhea Drug">Travelers' Diarrhea Drug</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentGiardiaAmebDrug.aspx" title="Giardiasis and Amebiasis Medication">Giardiasis and Amebiasis Medication</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentCounterfeitDrugs.aspx" title="Counterfeit Drugs">Counterfeit Drugs</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentIllnessInjuryAbroad.aspx" title="Illness &amp; Injury Abroad">Illness &amp; Injury Abroad</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentReferencesResources.aspx" title="References &amp; Resources">References &amp; Resources</a><ul><li><a href="/travel/contentReferences.aspx" title="References">References</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentResources.aspx" title="Resources">Resources</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentPresentationsHealthPros.aspx" title="Presentations for Health Professionals">Presentations for Health Professionals</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/travel/contentPodcasts.aspx" title="Travel Podcasts">Travel Podcasts</a></li><li><a href="/travel/contentRSS.aspx" title="RSS Feeds">RSS Feeds</a></li></ul></div><div class="bottom"></div></div><div id="breadBox"><ul id="breadcrumbs"><li style="display:none; background-image: none;"></li></ul></div><script language="javascript" type="text/javascript"><!--
